## 3. Prerequisites

Before setting up the AI Second Brain, ensure you have:

- Visual Studio Code
- Git
- Obsidian
- Access to the Rental-Ops-Manager repository
- Claude Code and/or OpenAI Codex installed and authenticated
- The unified Obsidian vault configuration
- The three AI configuration files

Both assistants should have appropriate file access to the local repository.

You do not need both AI assistants installed to use the Second Brain. Either one can follow the shared knowledge structure independently.

