## 5. How Codex and Claude Code Use the Second Brain

Both assistants follow a similar process.

```text
Developer asks for a change
            |
            v
AI reads AGENTS.md or CLAUDE.md
            |
            v
AI consults PROJECT_INDEX.md
            |
            v
AI reads relevant documentation
            |
            v
AI checks actual source code
            |
            v
AI implements the requested change
            |
            v
AI runs appropriate verification
            |
            v
AI updates affected documentation
            |
            v
Developer reviews changes
            |
            v
Changes are committed to Git
```

This is the intended development workflow, not a guaranteed automatic sequence. Developers should review the AI's output.

The index helps assistants locate information efficiently but never replaces reading the actual code when implementation details matter.

