## 12. Future Improvement — Automated Documentation Checks

A future enhancement is to use GitHub Actions or another Git-integrated workflow to identify application changes that require documentation review.

For example:

```text
Developer pushes code
         |
         v
GitHub workflow runs
         |
         v
Changed files are identified
         |
         v
Documentation impact is checked
         |
         v
Developer is prompted to review
         |
         v
Documentation update is approved
```

A basic workflow can flag changes without corresponding documentation updates.

An AI-enabled workflow could generate proposed documentation updates, but that requires additional configuration, permissions, and review safeguards.

This automation is **not included simply by creating `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, or `PROJECT_INDEX.md`**.

