## 13. Quick Troubleshooting

| Problem | Suggested solution |
|---|---|
| Claude does not seem to follow project instructions | Confirm `CLAUDE.md` exists at the repository root and restart the Claude Code session. |
| Codex does not use the index | Confirm `AGENTS.md` references `PROJECT_INDEX.md`. |
| AI cannot find documentation | Confirm the assistant is running inside the correct repository folder. |
| Obsidian cannot see `.project-memory` | Check the Hidden Folders Access plugin configuration. |
| Documentation was not updated after a code change | Ask the assistant to review the relevant diff and update affected notes. |
| Another developer sees old documentation | Pull the latest committed documentation changes from Git. |
| AI reports a test passed without running it | Request the exact test command and verification evidence. |
| A Git commit includes unwanted files | Review `git status` and stage only intended files. |

